# Background bird is independent of any speaker/character.
@scene dawn
background sunrise
"The morning bird is perched above the meadow."
ambient hide bird
"The bird hides behind the clouds."
ambient show bird
"The bird returns to the exact same position."
* "Walk into the cabin" -> indoors
* "Stay outside" -> dawn

@scene indoors
"The bird is outside. Even a previous show command cannot bypass its scene."
"The End."
